<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Marketing Poisson Singapore</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #061a2b, #0b2e4a, #0e4c5a);
      color: #eaf6ff;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 20px 50px;
    }

    .logo svg {
      width: 95px;
      height: 95px;
      stroke: #7fe7ff;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 2;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 44px;
      margin: 10px 0;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 18px;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 12px 26px;
      background: #00c2d1;
      color: #00131a;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #7fe7ff;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .services {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

  <!-- FISH LOGO -->
  <div class="logo">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200">
      <!-- fish body -->
      <path d="M40,100 C60,40 140,40 160,100 C140,160 60,160 40,100 Z"/>
      <!-- tail -->
      <path d="M160,100 L190,70 L190,130 Z"/>
      <!-- eye -->
      <circle cx="85" cy="85" r="5" fill="#7fe7ff"/>
      <!-- bones -->
      <line x1="70" y1="100" x2="130" y2="100"/>
      <line x1="85" y1="85" x2="85" y2="115"/>
      <line x1="100" y1="80" x2="100" y2="120"/>
      <line x1="115" y1="85" x2="115" y2="115"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <h1>Marketing Poisson Singapore</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">We help brands flow, grow, and dominate their ocean.</p>

  <a class="btn" href="#contact">Start Your Growth</a>
</header>

<section>
  <h2>About Us</h2>
  <p>
    Marketing Poisson Singapore is a creative marketing agency inspired by flow, precision, and movement.
    We build strong brand ecosystems that help businesses scale in a competitive digital ocean.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Trusted By</h2>
  <p>Selected partners we collaborate with on branding and growth.</p>

  <div class="services">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Vibrant Wines Singapore</h3>
      <p>Branding & marketing support for a premium wine lifestyle brand.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Our Services</h2>

  <div class="services">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Brand Strategy</h3>
      <p>Position your business like a dominant species in your market.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Digital Marketing</h3>
      <p>Ads, content, and social media strategies that convert attention into revenue.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Growth Campaigns</h3>
      <p>Performance-driven systems designed to scale sustainably.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Consulting</h3>
      <p>Expert guidance to navigate and dominate your marketing ecosystem.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Let’s build your next wave of growth.</p>
  <p>Email: contact@marketingpoisson.sg</p>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 Marketing Poisson Singapore — All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
